{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paperlands</i> is a relaxing 2D puzzle adventure set in a papercraft world where everything can be interacted with only if brought to life with color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with no colors and gradually unlock new colors as you complete both traditional and environmental puzzles while helping the people of Paperlands with their requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring things with different colors is the key and it can have interesting effects which will help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color the objects and people to be able to interact with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and traditional puzzles by using the colors, unlock new colors and reach new locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative and color the world to your liking</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the people of Paperlands with their requests as you progress on your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196370?t=1766350249","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196370?t=1766350249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/4cc830d1ef40f57956c30c4d6eb31a57722705f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766350249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/4cc830d1ef40f57956c30c4d6eb31a57722705f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766350249","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paperlands</